[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1518704920","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1948#issuecomment-1518704920","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1948","id":1518704920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85ahZkY","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-04-22T16:57:17Z","updated_at":"2023-04-22T16:57:17Z","body":"Hello @debonx,\r\n\r\nI am sure the team will have more questions, but for the \"Example Projects\" question, please provide several examples of real-world projects that are currently using this license in the form that you have requested here. The only Example Project you listed appears to be the repo for the license text itself.\r\n\r\nThis is related to the [license inclusion princples](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md) \"Other Factor\" 3:\r\n\r\n> The license has actual, substantial use such that it is likely to be encountered. Substantial use may be demonstrated via use in many projects, or in one or a few significant projects. For new licenses, there are definitive plans for the license to be used in one or a few significant projects.\r\n\r\nIf this license is a brand new proposal that has not seen actual, substantial use, or if it is only used (or proposed to be used) in a few personal projects, then I expect it is highly unlikely to satisfy the license inclusion principles overall. Particularly in light of what appears to be the restrictions on use which, from a quick glance, I am expecting would not satisfy the definitions referenced in \"Other Factor\" 1 from the inclusion principles.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1518704920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1518984773","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1948#issuecomment-1518984773","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1948","id":1518984773,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85aid5F","user":{"login":"debonx","id":10436541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDM2NTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10436541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx","html_url":"https://github.com/debonx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/debonx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-04-23T07:52:32Z","updated_at":"2023-04-23T07:52:32Z","body":"@swinslow thanks for the reply and clarification. I am collaborating with a relevant group of developers to start adopting it across their projects, but as you mentioned, being a brand new license, this will take sometime. Please be patient, I will collect all the needed information asap, hopefully within the next weeks. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1518984773/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1519079519","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1948#issuecomment-1519079519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1948","id":1519079519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85ai1Bf","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https: